SPEC_BUILD_OR_RUN=run mode. When false: legacy build+run per stage.'''
        ),
        string(name: 'STAGE1_SPEC_COPIES', defaultValue: '1',
               description: 'Stage 1 SPEC --copies (basic / functional validation).'),
        string(name: 'STAGE2_SPEC_COPIES', defaultValue: '512',
               description: 'Stage 2 SPEC --copies (full validation, gated on Stage 1 passing).'),
        booleanParam(name: 'ENABLE_STAGE2', defaultValue: false,
                     description: 'Run Stage 2 (full performance validation, e.g. 512 copies). Disabled by default; Stage 1 single-copy functional is the default for both CPU2017 and CPU2026.'),
        choice(name: 'STAGE1_SPEC_VALIDATION', choices: ['functional', 'performance'],
               description: 'Stage 1 SPEC_VALIDATION (csg_specslurm forces copies=1 under functional).'),
        choice(name: 'STAGE2_SPEC_VALIDATION', choices: ['performance', 'functional'],
               description: 'Stage 2 SPEC_VALIDATION (use performance so STAGE2_SPEC_COPIES is honored).'),

